#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/deploy-containers.rst:2
msgid "Deploy Mattermost using Containers"
msgstr "컨테이너를 사용하여 OKR.BEST 배포"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/deploy-containers.rst:4
msgid ""
"You can deploy Mattermost Server using container technologies for "
"exploring functionality, testing, and development purposes, as it allows "
"you to quickly set up a Mattermost instance without needing to manage the"
" underlying infrastructure. This deployment method shouldn't be used in "
"production environments as it doesn't support clustered deployments or "
"High Availability (HA) configurations out-of-the-box."
msgstr ""
"기능 탐색, 테스트, 개발 목적으로 컨테이너 기술을 사용하여 OKR.BEST 서버를 배포할 "
"수 있습니다. 기반 인프라를 관리할 필요 없이 OKR.BEST 인스턴스를 빠르게 설정할 수 "
"있기 때문입니다. 이 배포 방식은 기본적으로 클러스터 배포나 고가용성(HA) 구성을 "
"지원하지 않으므로 운영 환경에서 사용해서는 안 됩니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/deploy-containers.rst:7
msgid ""
"Choose your preferred container platform below for specific deployment "
"instructions:"
msgstr ""
"구체적인 배포 안내를 위해 아래에서 원하는 컨테이너 플랫폼을 선택하세요:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/fips-stig.rst:3
msgid ""
"From Mattermost v11, each release provides two variants: a FIPS-compliant"
" build and a non-FIPS build. This ensures that organizations with strict "
"compliance requirements can adopt the FIPS version while others can "
"continue with the standard release, both staying in sync with "
"Mattermost’s overall product lifecycle."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST v11부터 각 릴리스는 FIPS 준수 빌드와 비FIPS 빌드의 두 가지 변형을 "
"제공합니다. 이를 통해 엄격한 규정 준수 요건이 있는 조직은 FIPS 버전을 채택하고 그 "
"밖의 조직은 표준 릴리스를 계속 사용할 수 있으며, 둘 다 OKR.BEST의 전반적인 제품 "
"수명 주기와 동기화를 유지합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/fips-stig.rst:5
msgid ""
"Mattermost FIPS-compliant Docker images are built using Chainguard’s "
"FIPS-certified base containers. These images help organizations meet "
"stringent security requirements by ensuring compliance with the Federal "
"Information Processing Standards (FIPS)."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST FIPS 준수 Docker 이미지는 Chainguard의 FIPS 인증 베이스 컨테이너를 "
"사용하여 빌드됩니다. 이 이미지는 연방 정보 처리 표준(FIPS) 준수를 보장함으로써 "
"조직이 엄격한 보안 요건을 충족하는 데 도움이 됩니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/fips-stig.rst:7
msgid ""
"On top of this foundation, Mattermost product code itself is aligned with"
" FIPS requirements, using only FIPS-approved cryptographic algorithms. "
"This ensures that both the underlying container base and the application "
"layer meet compliance expectations."
msgstr ""
"이 기반 위에서 OKR.BEST 제품 코드 자체도 FIPS 요건에 맞춰 정렬되어 FIPS 승인 암호화 "
"알고리즘만 사용합니다. 이를 통해 기반 컨테이너 베이스와 애플리케이션 계층 모두가 "
"규정 준수 기대치를 충족하도록 보장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/fips-stig.rst:9
msgid ""
"In addition, the Chainguard base images are STIG-hardened and rigorously "
"scanned against the DISA General Purpose Operating System SRG, providing "
"a robust and secure operational posture."
msgstr ""
"또한 Chainguard 베이스 이미지는 STIG로 강화되어 DISA General Purpose Operating "
"System SRG에 대해 엄격하게 스캔되므로, 견고하고 안전한 운영 태세를 제공합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/fips-stig.rst:12
msgid "Mattermost FIPS Overview"
msgstr "OKR.BEST FIPS 개요"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/fips-stig.rst:14
msgid ""
"Mattermost’s FIPS-compliant images are built using two Chainguard base "
"images:"
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST의 FIPS 준수 이미지는 두 개의 Chainguard 베이스 이미지를 사용하여 "
"빌드됩니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/fips-stig.rst:16
msgid ""
"`Build-Time Image <https://images.chainguard.dev/directory/image/go-msft-"
"fips/overview>`_: Ensures compiled Mattermost binaries invoke OpenSSL "
"through CGO for FIPS-compliance during compilation."
msgstr ""
"`빌드 타임 이미지 <https://images.chainguard.dev/directory/image/go-msft-"
"fips/overview>`_: 컴파일된 OKR.BEST 바이너리가 컴파일 중 FIPS 준수를 위해 CGO를 "
"통해 OpenSSL을 호출하도록 보장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/fips-stig.rst:17
msgid ""
"`Runtime Image <https://images.chainguard.dev/directory/image/glibc-"
"openssl-fips/overview>`_: Enforces FIPS compliance in the runtime "
"environment using strict OpenSSL configurations."
msgstr ""
"`런타임 이미지 <https://images.chainguard.dev/directory/image/glibc-openssl-"
"fips/overview>`_: 엄격한 OpenSSL 구성을 사용하여 런타임 환경에서 FIPS 준수를 "
"적용합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/fips-stig.rst:19
msgid ""
"All application-level code uses only FIPS-approved algorithms, ensuring "
"that cryptographic requirements are consistently enforced across every "
"layer of the system."
msgstr ""
"모든 애플리케이션 수준 코드는 FIPS 승인 알고리즘만 사용하여 암호화 요건이 시스템의 "
"모든 계층에서 일관되게 적용되도록 보장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/fips-stig.rst:23
msgid ""
"The Mattermost FIPS image includes only prepackaged Boards, Playbooks, "
"and Agents. Additional plugins can be added to the Mattermost FIPS image,"
" but they will run in non-FIPS mode."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST FIPS 이미지에는 사전 패키징된 Boards, Playbooks, Agents만 포함됩니다. "
"OKR.BEST FIPS 이미지에 추가 플러그인을 더할 수 있지만, 비FIPS 모드로 "
"실행됩니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/fips-stig.rst:24
msgid ""
"Existing Docker or Kubernetes-based deployments can change the image from"
" ``mattermost/mattermost-enterprise-edition`` to ``mattermost/mattermost-"
"enterprise-fips-edition``."
msgstr ""
"기존 Docker 또는 Kubernetes 기반 배포는 이미지를 ``mattermost/mattermost-"
"enterprise-edition``\\ 에서 ``mattermost/mattermost-enterprise-fips-"
"edition``\\ 으로 변경할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:3
msgid ""
"This guide provides step-by-step instructions for deploying Mattermost "
"using Docker containers."
msgstr ""
"이 가이드는 Docker 컨테이너를 사용하여 OKR.BEST를 배포하는 단계별 안내를 "
"제공합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:7
msgid ""
"Mattermost server deployment using Docker is officially supported on "
"Linux operating systems only."
msgstr ""
"Docker를 사용한 OKR.BEST 서버 배포는 Linux 운영 체제에서만 공식 지원됩니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:8
msgid ""
"macOS and Windows Docker deployments are supported for testing and "
"development purposes only."
msgstr ""
"macOS 및 Windows Docker 배포는 테스트 및 개발 목적으로만 지원됩니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:9
msgid ""
"Docker is not ideal for High Availability (HA) because it lacks key "
"features including automatic failover, shared storage, and load "
"balancing. Docker also has challenges managing multiple nodes and "
"recovering from failures. We recommend :doc:`deploying on Kubernetes "
"</deployment-guide/server/deploy-kubernetes>` for HA for these features "
"to ensure reliability."
msgstr ""
"Docker는 자동 장애 조치, 공유 저장소, 부하 분산 등 주요 기능이 없기 때문에 "
"고가용성(HA)에 이상적이지 않습니다. 또한 Docker는 여러 노드를 관리하고 장애에서 "
"복구하는 데 어려움이 있습니다. 신뢰성을 보장하기 위해 이러한 기능을 갖춘 HA에는 "
":doc:`Kubernetes에 배포 </deployment-guide/server/deploy-kubernetes>`\\ 하는 "
"것을 권장합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:12
msgid "Install Docker"
msgstr "Docker 설치"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:14
msgid ""
"If you don't have Docker installed, follow the instructions below based "
"on your operating system. You'll need `Docker Engine "
"<https://docs.docker.com/engine/install/>`__ and `Docker Compose "
"<https://docs.docker.com/compose/install/>`_ (release 1.28 or later)."
msgstr ""
"Docker가 설치되어 있지 않다면 운영 체제에 따라 아래 안내를 따르세요. `Docker "
"Engine <https://docs.docker.com/engine/install/>`__\\ 과 `Docker Compose "
"<https://docs.docker.com/compose/install/>`_(릴리스 1.28 이상)가 필요합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:17
msgid "Deploy Mattermost on Docker"
msgstr "Docker에 OKR.BEST 배포"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:19
msgid ""
"This section provides a quick start guide for deploying Mattermost on "
"Docker by leveraging `Docker Compose "
"<https://docs.docker.com/compose/install/>`_."
msgstr ""
"이 섹션은 `Docker Compose <https://docs.docker.com/compose/install/>`_\\ 를 "
"활용하여 Docker에 OKR.BEST를 배포하는 빠른 시작 가이드를 제공합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:23
msgid ""
"The deployment configuration results in two separate containers: a "
"container for the database and a container for the application. An "
"optional third container results when using NGINX for reverse proxy."
msgstr ""
"이 배포 구성은 데이터베이스용 컨테이너와 애플리케이션용 컨테이너의 두 개의 별도 "
"컨테이너를 생성합니다. 리버스 프록시에 NGINX를 사용하는 경우 선택적으로 세 번째 "
"컨테이너가 생성됩니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:24
msgid ""
"Encountering issues with your Docker deployment? See the :doc:`Docker "
"deployment troubleshooting </deployment-guide/server/docker-"
"troubleshooting>` documentation for details."
msgstr ""
"Docker 배포에 문제가 발생했나요? 자세한 내용은 :doc:`Docker 배포 문제 해결 "
"</deployment-guide/server/docker-troubleshooting>` 문서를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:27
msgid "In a terminal window, clone the repository and enter the directory."
msgstr "터미널 창에서 저장소를 클론하고 디렉토리로 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:34
msgid ""
"Create your ``.env`` file by copying and adjusting the ``env.example`` "
"file."
msgstr ""
"``env.example`` 파일을 복사하고 조정하여 ``.env`` 파일을 생성합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:42
msgid ""
"At a minimum, you must edit the ``DOMAIN`` value in the ``.env`` file to "
"correspond to the domain for your Mattermost server."
msgstr ""
"최소한 ``.env`` 파일의 ``DOMAIN`` 값을 OKR.BEST 서버의 도메인에 맞게 수정해야 "
"합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:43
msgid ""
"We recommend configuring the :ref:`Support Email <administration-"
"guide/configure/site-configuration-settings:support email address>` via "
"``MM_SUPPORTSETTINGS_SUPPORTEMAIL``. This is the email address your users"
" will contact when they need help."
msgstr ""
"``MM_SUPPORTSETTINGS_SUPPORTEMAIL``\\ 을 통해 :ref:`지원 이메일 <administration-"
"guide/configure/site-configuration-settings:support email address>`\\ 을 구성할 "
"것을 권장합니다. 이는 사용자가 도움이 필요할 때 연락할 이메일 주소입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:45
msgid "Create the required directories and set their permissions."
msgstr "필요한 디렉토리를 생성하고 권한을 설정합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:52
msgid ""
"*(Optional)* Configure TLS for NGINX. If you're not using the included "
"NGINX reverse proxy, you can skip this step."
msgstr ""
"*(선택 사항)* NGINX용 TLS를 구성합니다. 포함된 NGINX 리버스 프록시를 사용하지 "
"않는다면 이 단계를 건너뛸 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:56
msgid ""
"**Resource limits:** If you're using a custom ``docker-compose.yml`` file"
" that sets `pids_limit`, we recommend using ``mem_limit`` instead to "
"constrain resources while allowing normal connection scaling. Low "
"``pids_limit`` values can prevent the container from creating enough "
"processes or threads, which may lead to unstable behavior under load. The"
" current default in ``docker-compose.yml`` is set to ``mem_limit: 4G``."
msgstr ""
"**리소스 제한:** `pids_limit`\\ 을 설정하는 사용자 지정 ``docker-compose.yml`` "
"파일을 사용하는 경우, 정상적인 연결 확장을 허용하면서 리소스를 제한하기 위해 대신 "
"``mem_limit`` 사용을 권장합니다. ``pids_limit`` 값이 낮으면 컨테이너가 충분한 "
"프로세스나 스레드를 생성하지 못해 부하 상태에서 불안정한 동작으로 이어질 수 "
"있습니다. ``docker-compose.yml``\\ 의 현재 기본값은 ``mem_limit: 4G``\\ 로 "
"설정되어 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:59
msgid "Create a new certificate and key"
msgstr "새 인증서와 키 생성"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:65
msgid ""
"To include the certificate and key, uncomment the following lines in your"
" ``.env`` file and ensure they point to the appropriate files."
msgstr ""
"인증서와 키를 포함하려면 ``.env`` 파일에서 다음 줄의 주석을 해제하고 적절한 "
"파일을 가리키는지 확인하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:73
msgid "Use a pre-existing certificate and key"
msgstr "기존 인증서와 키 사용"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:81
msgid ""
"To include the certificate and key, ensure the following lines in your "
"``.env`` file points to the appropriate files."
msgstr ""
"인증서와 키를 포함하려면 ``.env`` 파일의 다음 줄이 적절한 파일을 가리키는지 "
"확인하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:88
msgid "Deploy Mattermost."
msgstr "OKR.BEST를 배포합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:91
msgid "Deploy without using the included NGINX"
msgstr "포함된 NGINX를 사용하지 않고 배포"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:97
msgid ""
"To access your new Mattermost deployment, navigate to "
"``http://<YOUR_MM_DOMAIN>:8065/`` in your browser."
msgstr ""
"새 OKR.BEST 배포에 접근하려면 브라우저에서 ``http://<YOUR_MM_DOMAIN>:8065/``\\ 로 "
"이동하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:99
#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:114
msgid "To shut down your deployment:"
msgstr "배포를 종료하려면:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:106
msgid "Deploy using the included NGINX"
msgstr "포함된 NGINX를 사용하여 배포"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:112
msgid ""
"To access your new Mattermost deployment via HTTPS, navigate to "
"``https://<YOUR_MM_DOMAIN>/`` in your browser."
msgstr ""
"HTTPS를 통해 새 OKR.BEST 배포에 접근하려면 브라우저에서 "
"``https://<YOUR_MM_DOMAIN>/``\\ 로 이동하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:120
msgid ""
"Create your first Mattermost system admin user, :doc:`invite more users "
"</end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-members>`, and explore the "
"Mattermost platform."
msgstr ""
"첫 번째 OKR.BEST 시스템 관리자 사용자를 만들고, :doc:`더 많은 사용자를 초대 "
"</end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-members>`\\ 한 다음, OKR.BEST "
"플랫폼을 살펴보세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:123
msgid "Configure SSO With GitLab (Optional)"
msgstr "GitLab으로 SSO 구성(선택 사항)"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:125
msgid ""
"To use SSO with GitLab with a self-signed certificate, you have to add "
"the PKI chain for your authority. This is required to avoid the ``Token "
"request failed: certificate signed by unknown authority`` error."
msgstr ""
"자체 서명 인증서로 GitLab과 SSO를 사용하려면 해당 기관의 PKI 체인을 추가해야 "
"합니다. 이는 ``Token request failed: certificate signed by unknown "
"authority`` 오류를 방지하는 데 필요합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:127
msgid ""
"To add the PKI chain, uncomment the following line in your ``.env`` file,"
" and ensure it points to your ``pki_chain.pem`` file:"
msgstr ""
"PKI 체인을 추가하려면 ``.env`` 파일에서 다음 줄의 주석을 해제하고 "
"``pki_chain.pem`` 파일을 가리키는지 확인하세요:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:133
msgid ""
"Then uncomment the following line in your ``docker-compose.yml`` file, "
"and ensure it points to the same ``pki_chain.pem`` file:"
msgstr ""
"그런 다음 ``docker-compose.yml`` 파일에서 다음 줄의 주석을 해제하고 동일한 "
"``pki_chain.pem`` 파일을 가리키는지 확인하세요:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:140
msgid "Upgrade from mattermost-docker"
msgstr "mattermost-docker에서 업그레이드"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:142
msgid ""
"The `mattermost-docker <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-"
"docker>`__ GitHub repository is deprecated. Visit the `mattermost/docker "
"<https://github.com/mattermost/docker>`_ GitHub repository to access the "
"official Docker deployment solution for Mattermost."
msgstr ""
"`mattermost-docker <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-docker>`__ "
"GitHub 저장소는 지원 중단되었습니다. OKR.BEST의 공식 Docker 배포 솔루션에 "
"접근하려면 `mattermost/docker <https://github.com/mattermost/docker>`_ GitHub "
"저장소를 방문하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/server/containers/install-docker.rst:144
msgid ""
"To migrate from an existing ``mattermost/mattermost-prod-app`` image, we "
"recommend migrating to either ``mattermost/mattermost-enterprise-"
"edition`` or ``mattermost/mattermost-team-edition`` images, which are the"
" official images supported by Mattermost. These images support PostgreSQL"
